        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Square shawl of woven silk and wool. Creamy white wool with decoration in brown slubbed spots repeated in staggered rows over the ground, and with brown stripes forming a narrow border containing slubbed yarns in purple and puce. There is a short fringe, warp and weft, on all four sides. The shawl is reversible."@en ;
